  "details": "We can all agree on that hilarious moments sometimes happen in VRChat. Wouldn't it be nice to be able to have these moments captured completely so that you literary could relive those experiences? An recorded experience would contain recorded:\n\n* Avatar movements for everybody in that instance\n* All avatar voices \n* Things like in which instance that experience took place\n\nPlayers could then vote on the funniest moments and other players could then enter those memories and experience them first hand.",
